From 0cc8333c5e4354a09fce7332e0f4a3155223f01c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 11:45:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 288/288] reaper: i18n completeness pass - tokenize the three
 pages that shipped hardcoded-English (Reaper_Conn, Reaper_QoSDiag, and the
 WiFiPro option words + Wireless printable report), plus the QoS Diagnostics
 menu tab. 132 new dict tokens (RCON_1-34, RQD_0-60, RWFP_20-38, RWIF_62-80)
 translated across all 25 languages, the 14 English-seeded RWFP_1-14 chrome
 keys given real translations, and heavy reuse of existing stock tokens for
 common words. Dicts lockstep at 6155; validated by node --check of every
 inline script resolved in all 25 languages (100/100) + reaper_langcheck (0
 breakers) + ASCII-clean pages. No feature/code change - localization only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
